          ">>> s = str(factorial(1000))\n>>> s[:16]\n'4023872600770937'\n>>> len(s)\n2568",
          "This tells us 1000! = 4.023872600770937 × 102567. Therefore",
          "log(1000!) = log(4.023872600770937) + 2567 log(10)",
